    <item>
      <title>Magnet for B2B Lead Gen</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1316/for-business/leadgen/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1316/for-business/leadgen/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;long-forms-kill-conversion-short-forms-miss-context&#34; class=&#34;m5-md-h2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--lg2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Long Forms Kill Conversion. Short Forms Miss Context.&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You know the tradeoff. A long form gets you qualified leads but tanks your conversion rate. A short form gets volume but buries your team in unqualified noise. Magnet eliminates the tradeoff.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A conversational flow collects the same information as a 10-field form, but each question builds on the last. It feels fast because it&amp;rsquo;s relevant. The prospect doesn&amp;rsquo;t think &amp;ldquo;I&amp;rsquo;m filling out a form.&amp;rdquo; They think &amp;ldquo;this company is paying attention.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Magnet for B2B SaaS</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1316/for-business/saas/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1316/for-business/saas/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-problem-with-saas-demo-forms&#34; class=&#34;m5-md-h2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--lg2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The Problem With SaaS Demo Forms&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your visitor clicks &amp;ldquo;Book a Demo.&amp;rdquo; They see a form with 8 fields. Name, email, company, role, company size, use case, timeline, budget. They fill in three and leave. You never hear from them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Magnet replaces that form with a quick conversation. Two or three questions, branched based on their answers, and they&amp;rsquo;re looking at a calendar. The whole thing takes 30 seconds.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Magnet for E-Commerce</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1316/for-business/ecommerce/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1316/for-business/ecommerce/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;shoppers-dont-want-to-search-they-want-to-be-shown&#34; class=&#34;m5-md-h2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--lg2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Shoppers Don&amp;rsquo;t Want to Search. They Want to Be Shown.&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Product catalogs are overwhelming. Filters help, but most visitors don&amp;rsquo;t know what they&amp;rsquo;re filtering for. A product quiz asks three questions and recommends the right item. It feels like talking to a knowledgeable associate, not using a search engine.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;m5-uc-break py-10 md:py-14&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent&#34;&gt;Use cases&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 class=&#34;m5-uc-heading mt-2 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight&#34; data-magnet-h&gt;&#xA;      How Can Magnet Help Me&lt;span class=&#34;m5-uc-answer&#34; data-uc-answer&gt;&amp;hellip;?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-fmt-glyphrow&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;0&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Product recommendation quizzes&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Product recommendation quizzes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;1&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Exit-intent flows&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;door_open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Exit-intent flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;2&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Post-purchase feedback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;star&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Post-purchase feedback&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;3&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Journeys that show the drop-off&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Journeys that show the drop-off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc mx-auto px-6&#34; data-usecases&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-pills&#34; role=&#34;tablist&#34; aria-label=&#34;Pick a use case&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill is-active&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;0&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;true&#34; data-answer=&#34;guide shoppers to the right product&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Product recommendation quizzes&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;1&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;catch leaving visitors&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;door_open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Exit-intent flows&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;2&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;collect reviews while it is fresh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;star&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Post-purchase feedback&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;3&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;see which question loses shoppers&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Journeys that show the drop-off&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-panels&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-panel is-active&#34; data-uc-panel=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-step&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-uc-num&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1316/images/screenshots/flow-builder.png&#34; alt=&#34;Three questions on the canvas: occasion, budget, style.&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; data-lightbox=&#34;Three questions on the canvas: occasion, budget, style.&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;p&gt;Three questions on the canvas: occasion, budget, style.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Magnet for Professional Services</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1316/for-business/services/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1316/for-business/services/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;your-contact-form-doesnt-tell-you-anything-useful&#34; class=&#34;m5-md-h2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--lg2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;quiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Your Contact Form Doesn&amp;rsquo;t Tell You Anything Useful&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Name, email, message.&amp;rdquo; That&amp;rsquo;s what most service firm contact pages collect. Then someone on your team has to email back, ask qualifying questions, go back and forth, and eventually schedule a call. That&amp;rsquo;s three days of friction for what could be a 30-second conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;m5-uc-break py-10 md:py-14&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent&#34;&gt;Use cases&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 class=&#34;m5-uc-heading mt-2 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight&#34; data-magnet-h&gt;&#xA;      How Can Magnet Help Me&lt;span class=&#34;m5-uc-answer&#34; data-uc-answer&gt;&amp;hellip;?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-fmt-glyphrow&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;0&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Consultation booking&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;event_available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Consultation booking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;1&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Service matching&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;call_split&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Service matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;2&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show Intake questionnaires&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;assignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;Intake questionnaires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-glyphbtn&#34; data-glyph-for=&#39;[data-uc-nav=&#34;3&#34;]&#39; aria-label=&#34;Show One panel for every channel&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-glyphlabel&#34;&gt;One panel for every channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc mx-auto px-6&#34; data-usecases&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-pills&#34; role=&#34;tablist&#34; aria-label=&#34;Pick a use case&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill is-active&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;0&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;true&#34; data-answer=&#34;book consultations&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;event_available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Consultation booking&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;1&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;route inquiries to the right team&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;call_split&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Service matching&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;2&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;replace intake paperwork&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;assignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Intake questionnaires&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;m5-uc-pill&#34; data-uc-nav=&#34;3&#34; aria-pressed=&#34;false&#34; data-answer=&#34;staff only the channels I run&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-flowglyph m5-flowglyph--sm&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;material-symbols-rounded&#34;&gt;apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;One panel for every channel&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-panels&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-panel is-active&#34; data-uc-panel=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;m5-uc-step&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m5-uc-num&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1316/images/examples/warner-reed/02-open.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The conversation starts where the contact form was.&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; data-lightbox=&#34;The conversation starts where the contact form was.&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;p&gt;The conversation starts where the contact form was.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
